"naa lati gba Onkọwe lati oju-iwe profaili ati kii ṣe eyikeyi awọn "
"ifiweranṣẹ miiran lori iboju kanna."

#: src/modules/multiple-authors/multiple-authors.php:1500
#, php-format
msgid ""
"There is one final option to mention. This is mostly useful if you're using "
"a theme or page builder to customize the Author profile pages you find at "
"URLs such as /author/username/. You can use the following shortcode on the "
"authors page to display the profile of the current author. You just need to "
"add the parameter %s."
msgstr ""
"Iṣeduro ikẹhin kan wa lati mẹnuba. Eyi jẹ pupọ wulo ti o ba nlo akori tabi "
"oluṣeto oju-iwe lati ṣe akanṣe awọn oju-iwe profaili Onkọwe ti o rii ni "
"awọn URL bi /author/username/. O le lo shortcode atẹle lori oju-iwe awọn "
"onkọwe lati fi han profaili onkọwe lọwọlọwọ. O kan nilo lati fi kun "
"paramita %s."

#: src/modules/multiple-authors/multiple-authors.php:1509
